[ti:Keep the Fire Burning]
[length:03:44.832]

[00:13.00]The morning light is breaking in Lahore,
[00:18.00]While midnight settles on your distant shore.
[00:23.00]I know you're pulling down the window blinds,
[00:28.00]And leaving all the heavy day behind.
[00:33.00]I trace the little pixels on the screen,
[00:37.50]The most beautiful face I've ever seen.
[00:44.00]A half a world away, a different sky...
[00:49.00]But I can hear the softness in your sigh...
[00:56.00]I will keep the fire burning till you come back home!
[01:01.50]You never have to walk this heavy road alone!
[01:07.00]I carry every promise that we ever made!
[01:12.50]A quiet kind of love that never fades!
[01:18.00]Aaaahhh huh haaaa!
[01:22.00]Laaa la la laaaa!
[01:31.00]I leave the phone right next to me in bed,
[01:36.00]Just so I can hear you breathing deep.
[01:41.00]It closes up the thousands of miles,
[01:46.00]To know I'm right beside you when you sleep.
[01:51.00]We share the day and pass the sun along,
[01:56.00]You are the only place where I belong.
